{"id":"f84615aea647a602","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-lambda-beta-confluence.md","title":"β 归约合流","display":"thm-lambda-beta-confluence — β 归约合流","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-lambda-beta-confluence","aliases":["56-thm-lambda-beta-confluence"],"display":"thm-lambda-beta-confluence — β 归约合流","depends_on":["[[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]]","[[56-thm-lambda-triangle]]","[[56-df-confluent]]","[[56-df-relation-closure]]","[[56-thm-relational-sandwich-confluence]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Theorem 10.2.5 and proof, printed p556","source_ocr_block":"577","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-read; local-dependency-chain-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-lambda-beta-confluence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-lambda-beta-confluence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lambda-beta-confluence — β 归约合流"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"752f53ceb23d931c\" href=\"?note=752f53ceb23d931c\" title=\"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction\">56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52fbf9496f872506\" href=\"?note=52fbf9496f872506\" title=\"56-thm-lambda-triangle\">56-thm-lambda-triangle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28e999711473c30c\" href=\"?note=28e999711473c30c\" title=\"56-thm-relational-sandwich-confluence\">56-thm-relational-sandwich-confluence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Theorem 10.2.5 and proof, printed p556"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"577"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-read; local-dependency-chain-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\">\\(\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_\\beta\">\\(\\to_\\beta\\)</span> 是无类型 λ 演算的 β 归约，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\)</span> 为同时归约，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"752f53ceb23d931c\" href=\"?note=752f53ceb23d931c\" title=\"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction\">56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_\\beta\\ \\subseteq\\ \\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\ \\subseteq\\ (\\to_\\beta)^*,\\qquad\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\Lambda,\\to_\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_\\beta\\ \\subseteq\\ \\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\ \\subseteq\\ (\\to_\\beta)^*,\\qquad\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\Lambda,\\to_\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 10.2.5 及证明（印刷 p556，OCR 页块577）。三角性质蕴含同时归约的菱形性质；两侧包含关系按定义归纳，于是由关系夹逼合流引理得到 β 合流。这里沿原书链给出本地依赖，不假定 β 强正规化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"752f53ceb23d931c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-lambda-triangle","status":"resolved","id":"52fbf9496f872506","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-lambda-triangle]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"c74959a8cb14eaa5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-relational-sandwich-confluence","status":"resolved","id":"28e999711473c30c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-relational-sandwich-confluence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"752f53ceb23d931c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$\\to_\\beta$ 是无类型 λ 演算的 β 归约，$\\Rightarrow_\\lambda$ 为同时归约，见 [[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_\\beta\\ \\subseteq\\ \\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\ \\subseteq\\ (\\to_\\beta)^*,\\qquad\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\Lambda,\\to_\\beta).","display":true}],"bytes":1281,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-297","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-lambda-beta-confluence.md]]"}],"outgoing":["752f53ceb23d931c","52fbf9496f872506","c74959a8cb14eaa5","9ddd157960e9574a","28e999711473c30c"]}